@startuml

title Grant Management: the lifecycle of a grant


hide empty description
[*] --> active : create, on behalf of the person;\nthe person holds the whole scope
active --> active : use: a token exchange;\nthe grantor still holds the scope
active --> revoked : revoke: the work ends
active --> exhausted : the last permitted use
active --> expired : not_after passes
state lapsed <<choice>>
active --> lapsed : use, after the grantor\nleft or lost the scope
lapsed --> active : the use is refused\n(grant_lapsed); the grant\nstays until revoked
revoked --> [*]
exhausted --> [*]
expired --> [*]
@enduml
